    > The claw closes. It lifts. For the first time in recorded history, Mr. Kim does not let go.
    @if var.plush == "whale"
        > The blue whale tumbles down the chute, faded smile first.
    @elif var.plush == "dino"
        > The green dinosaur tumbles down the chute, missing tooth first.
    @elif var.plush == "star"
        > The yellow star tumbles down the chute, and lands the right way up for the first time in years.
    @else
